    Bug 1857413 - Set min-height on subscribe dialog's <dialog> element. r=mkmelin

    This isn't perfect, the dialog is slightly too short on Windows, but it's better than it was. It's the same thing we do on several other dialogs.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D226585

diff --git a/mail/themes/shared/mail/subscribe.css b/mail/themes/shared/mail/subscribe.css
index 423ec8fbc2d..4f74d6ea17e 100644
--- a/mail/themes/shared/mail/subscribe.css
+++ b/mail/themes/shared/mail/subscribe.css
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@

 @import url("chrome://messenger/skin/messenger.css");

-#subscribeWindow {
+#subscribeWindow, dialog {
   min-width: 40em;
   min-height: 30em;
 }
